OL,3,AFBI investigates claim by hackers they
OL,4,Astole data on all agency staff
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe FBI says it is investigating a
OL,7,Freported breach of its system after a
OL,8,Fcybercrime group claimed to have stolen
OL,9,Fsensitive information on thousands of
OL,10,Fbureau personnel.
OL,12,FThe hackers, Shiny Hunters, say they
OL,13,Fnow hold private data on all the bureau
OL,14,Fstaff - around 38,000 people -
OL,15,Fincluding anyone who applied to join
OL,16,Fthe investigative agency.
OL,18,FThe group says it has every agent's
OL,19,Fname, role, badge number and personal
OL,20,Fdetails including home address, phone
OL,21,Fnumbers and spouse information.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
