OL,3,AFBI investigates claim by hackers they
OL,4,Astole data on all agency staff
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement posted on X, the FBI
OL,7,Fsaid it was aware of the claim and the
OL,8,Fagency was "actively and aggressively
OL,9,Finvestigating the matter".
